                    <h2 class="vr-title" style="font-size:54px;letter-spacing:8px;color:#ffd84a;text-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.7),0 0 36px rgba(255,216,74,0.4);margin:0;line-height:1;">OPTIONS</h2>
